settings
├── when reading a display
│   ├── it reads the number
│   ├── it drops the screen suffix
│   ├── it rejects a display with no colon
│   └── it rejects a nonnumeric display
└── when resolving settings
    ├── it preserves explicit overrides
    ├── it rejects an invalid display
    ├── it keeps state paths under the data directory
    ├── it binds endpoint urls to loopback
    └── it persists settings into the service environment
